{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "b4c06020b037085828403b4527bfbb4ec0bfbb2b127bd7e7987ee6c8e92c8dca", "ja": "相克のエモーション", "zh": "矛盾的Emotion", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "983fc860609ce8ba4ed16b753d36ccd3f8bcf684c030723b7ca730228e471ec5", "ja": "落ち込んでしまった未来を励ますため、\n散歩に連れ出すプロデューサー。静香や翼と\n話をした事で、2人から元気をもらう未来。\n仲間は一番身近なライバルである、という\n言葉を受け止める未来。", "zh": "为了鼓舞情绪低落的未来，\n制作人带她到户外散步。与静香和翼聊过后，\n未来从两人身上再次获得能量，开始思考\n「伙伴是近在咫尺的劲敌」这个说法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a43590633cf2414ca0a71fff630aa1f7b79e511495ab9a09d9230befa4c7a21c", "ja": "（春香が帰った後も、未来はうつむいたままだ。\n少し、考える時間が必要かもしれないな……）", "zh": "（春香回去后，未来还是一直低着头。\n也许她需要一些时间思考……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1001_p", "source_sha256": "6caccab6cedc89fa453203291d2affc6a24280286c7f60a6321a316a0d9c81c9", "ja": "その前に、ふたりにメールを送って……\nうん、これでいいな。", "zh": "先传简讯给另外两个人……\n嗯，这样就可以了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1003_p", "source_sha256": "8f728bf9000e55b1317707f1937d024caafce67494ba80a8b9ab816ba566b48c", "ja": "未来、ちょっと散歩に行こう。\n何か食べたいものはあるか？", "zh": "未来，我们去散散步吧。\n你有没有想吃什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "d48cf20fbd871fea833f58fa5e882ceeb1597cfcc2a97d3b7b53f5c09d406d7d", "ja": "えっ……いいんですか！？　じゃあ私、\nコンビニの生クリームまんじゅうが食べたいです！", "zh": "咦……可以吗！？\n那我想吃便利商店的鲜奶油馒头！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "4aea55133443624393b57464bd8aaf640b9aaf5c4c98d41fd2a3419e514a5843", "ja": "はあーっ、おいしかった～。\n{$P$}さん、ごちそうさまでした。", "zh": "呼～真好吃～\n{$P$}先生，谢谢招待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1006_p", "source_sha256": "62ba1f5072cd480ea0d59cf1e92a6c7b0055ae4eda78b846aedaef0ffbfc1a1b", "ja": "どういたしまして。……さて、そろそろ\n練習に戻らないとだけど……今度は大丈夫そうか？", "zh": "不客气……那我们差不多该回去练习了……\n不过你想通了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "1b13070a78e3b8e063c7c5224dad2b30ea67ca12ca8e2431adf904c40c1420ac", "ja": "あっ。そ、そうでした。\nうう……私、どうしたらいいんだろう？", "zh": "啊，对、对喔。\n呜呜……我该怎么做才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b9a09ed8ed7b0d092468ce44c7c82067ea08fba114e8c369409c71d71ffc5c84", "ja": "あ！　いたいた。\n未来、{$P$}さ～ん！", "zh": "啊！找到了。\n未来、{$P$}先生～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "bc0233b11f4a6e03a34e463ea2ecbfc6c95139872c86bfa663b7b44edebfb407", "ja": "未来ったら、買い食いなんかして……。\nでも、思ったより元気そうね。", "zh": "未来你真是的，还买零食吃……\n但你看起来比想像中更有精神呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "59e29212ae569c7e5511a707c51a2015089ad470675f169790fead007aebf6ce", "ja": "あれ？　静香ちゃんに、翼？\nどうしてここにいるの？", "zh": "咦？是小静和翼？\n你们怎么在这里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "90c029f98e4d73c7c3f86b75a3a3b622fcd35ae7d4cf2fd4bda26cf594d6933b", "ja": "だって{$P$}さんが、\n未来が落ち込んでるっていうから～。", "zh": "因为{$P$}先生说\n未来现在很沮丧啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "9e96036e3f00271e0ff0b9a78aa2bfbcd30cd1d236c4597d137a19a0b5cf2df0", "ja": "ええっ！？　いつの間に……。\nもしかしてふたりとも、私を心配して来てくれたの？", "zh": "咦咦！？什么时候说的……\n你们两个该不会是担心我才过来的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1013_p", "source_sha256": "74c93c31f2c9f782c83250d4babe9c5f88dc8c5ba0413a8d6c3558b8eb14a1cb", "ja": "とりあえず、ここじゃなんだから、\nみんな、別のところに移動しようか？", "zh": "总之这边也不方便说话，\n我们先移动到其他地方吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "abca11c193508cdb3ce5be8453f5c85fb9037047dd15a6f1daa3ca5313e9f581", "ja": "それで……せっかくドラマ出演が決まったのに、\n琴葉さんと春香さんに叱られたんですって？", "zh": "然后……你好不容易能参与电视剧演出，\n却被琴叶和春香训了一顿？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "5c85f1d246b59cb19a902ba020430486f45a18c02761e0d49da34ae5180d11b5", "ja": "うん……。私が本気じゃないと、ダメなんだって。\n琴葉ちゃんたちまで、ニセモノに見えちゃうって……。", "zh": "嗯……她们说我一定要认真投入才行，\n不然连琴叶她们看起来都会假假的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "0b9f06bc34c593e358dd7b8dc4a193fbe6c0e0dab51322baa00c455df608c747", "ja": "琴葉ちゃんや春香さんの言ってること、なんとなく\nわかるんだけど。私には、難しいよ～……。", "zh": "虽然我大概可以理解琴叶和春香的意思，\n但对我来说还是太难了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1017_p", "source_sha256": "17082fe5fbc4d7468ea5140c5dd9013c4ac94aa9762a7a0c52837e7e1ea6a436", "ja": "（素直な未来には、お芝居で『別人』と思い込む事の\nハードルが、人より高いのかもしれないな……）", "zh": "（要直率的未来在演戏时把她们当成『不同的人』，\n这难度或许比别人更高呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "894d1b38d4b0e9b2bcd936a701f21a67c6633134cfba8414b9f1083881dcca66", "ja": "でも、お芝居ってそういうものだし。琴葉さんや\n可奈のことを、今は本気でライバルだと思えば……。", "zh": "但演戏就是这么回事，\n只要现在暂时把琴叶和可奈当作真正的竞争对手……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "65ca9cfa471095011c564c7b5fbfbb82466f56e30e215684b180ce5823a66dab", "ja": "うう～ん、それはわかるんだけど……。\n琴葉ちゃんのこと、嫌いになんてなれないよ～！", "zh": "呜呜～这我也懂啦……\n但我就是没办法讨厌琴叶啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1020_016tsu", "source_sha256": "bf064d997885bc2c73c5d41ff41a50482033bd7d10fc92a2238596658e955d62", "ja": "え？　別に琴葉さんは、\n嫌いになれなんて言ってなくない？", "zh": "咦？\n没人叫你讨厌琴叶吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "23c9d65afec8fb5d51a8bdb557a919813e1a07f6552039cf3368751532ee8958", "ja": "でも、本気で怒りをぶつけろ、って……。\n怒るのって、嫌いだからじゃないの？", "zh": "但她要我把真实的愤怒发泄出来……\n生气不就是因为讨厌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1022_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c26cc1d91b6ec33242361812ab8bd018d2dbaebd8e2e82dd369b169fc7f274bf", "ja": "怒ってるのは、お芝居の役に、だよね？\n琴葉さんの役と、琴葉さんは別の人でしょ。", "zh": "你要生气的对象是戏里的角色对吧？\n琴叶演的角色和她本身是不同人喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1023_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d7f8b0edd1d2cf7ae1e394de2e47832381cd8d0da57f4bca121ecaf69cfe4c06", "ja": "違う人の役なのに、いつもみたいに仲良くしてるほうが\nわたしはヘンだと思うけどな～。", "zh": "明明就是不同的人，却像平常一样和睦相处，\n我觉得这样反而比较奇怪耶～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1024_014mir", "source_sha256": "d4fc2b4ad4adff01c92048efe17ec5af9376a0f5bd78e31608c6d31f1743eb1b", "ja": "琴葉ちゃんの役と、琴葉ちゃんは別……？　でも、\n目の前にいたら、琴葉ちゃんだって思っちゃうし。", "zh": "琴叶演的角色和琴叶本身是不同的人……？\n但只要出现在我面前，我就会觉得她是琴叶呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1025_014mir", "source_sha256": "0b0d13e7c6d6892f97eaa5e40419f0ab9c8b88939eec3e5453695ad4aa2bceb1", "ja": "どうしてみんな、そんなふうに\nわけて考えられるのかなぁ……？", "zh": "为什么大家都能分开想呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1026_015siz", "source_sha256": "2ec7a76911c84953a20efc534c334c4f4601acf631f9330638f257437d87de93", "ja": "もう、仕方ないわね……。\nだからって投げ出すつもりじゃないでしょ？　未来。", "zh": "真是的，拿你没办法……\n但即便这样，你也不打算放弃对吧，未来？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1027_014mir", "source_sha256": "f08edc92db4e4c9f86946e009b96825e6150dd051084f51d01d389b51d13a861", "ja": "う、うん！　それはしないよ。\nだって、せっかくオーディションに受かったんだもん！", "zh": "对、对啊！我不会放弃的。\n因为我好不容易才通过试镜嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1028_015siz", "source_sha256": "4fda70517fe679df7fd1707837131e41104c7ef175d06b9889ff3a67a3753737", "ja": "……よかった。なら、もうちょっとがんばって。\n練習相手が必要なら、いつでも付き合うから。", "zh": "……太好了，那就再努力一下吧。\n如果需要练习的对象，我随时都能陪你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1029_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d3c3b04d011515ad28eadcc7dcd6d4d8cf2fc8da563ab143275e91936f1a74ec", "ja": "わたしも、手伝ってあげる～。", "zh": "我也很愿意帮忙～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1030_014mir", "source_sha256": "0bc4dbe936e0dd35bce71d37d0757d7b5707e7592b896e482be0c80d955a983d", "ja": "うん！\n静香ちゃん、翼、ありがとう！", "zh": "嗯！\n小静、翼，谢谢你们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1031_016tsu", "source_sha256": "969e4907115de52072b370cbec2db488fcce5a6c4bd5531de35caf27fa1dddad", "ja": "どういたしまして♪\nお礼はアイスでいいからね、未来！", "zh": "不用客气♪\n下次请我吃冰就好了，未来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1032_p", "source_sha256": "941febf01df69e36426ceeb3c6528b5279a0b4f2622647ddf0cb9b60c9879548", "ja": "よかったな、未来。\n静香と翼が来てくれて。", "zh": "静香和翼有来找你真是太好了呢，未来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1033_014mir", "source_sha256": "7f2bd6eea1b77de0e4839a813b7d75aef974ce8b662b406afeac0391fd7c7015", "ja": "はい！　{$P$}さん、\nありがとうございました。私、すっごくうれしいです！", "zh": "是的！{$P$}先生，\n谢谢你，我觉得很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1034_014mir", "source_sha256": "aa37707c9d6b86c7ffd70ce75f60e1ab5758fc079b1cef50c50fe2a8fa850efe", "ja": "静香ちゃんと翼が来てくれて、元気が出ました♪\n練習、がんばらなくちゃ……！", "zh": "因为小静和翼过来，我又打起精神了♪\n要继续努力练习才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1035_p", "source_sha256": "014a092a91c5acf943f0969f7be8d888370b3ce500563b1c246d23c5a991fe45", "ja": "そうだな。でも静香や翼に練習を付き合ってもらうなら\n琴葉や春香と同じように、ふたりとぶつかるって事だ。", "zh": "是啊，但如果要请静香或翼陪你练习，就代表你也要和\n她们两个对立，就像和琴叶、春香练习时那样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1036_014mir", "source_sha256": "a2c8df994dfab829f5203ad6554197f2c3623c524657767cd5575f02b0fee477", "ja": "はい……。", "zh": "好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1037_p", "source_sha256": "ee84e21abed98279e95c16389c3c5d03db045d83e652ff4d4046b325f95e901b", "ja": "琴葉も春香も、静香も翼も。みんな未来の仲間だ。\nけど仲間は、一番身近なライバルでもあるんだよ。", "zh": "无论琴叶、春香、静香还是翼，大家都是未来的伙伴，\n但伙伴同时也是近在咫尺的劲敌喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1038_014mir", "source_sha256": "8648052857f7b2a3e5aaa6a5a9eaf7b1c46578bfd67c701810a0cf8350ceff05", "ja": "一番身近な、ライバル……？", "zh": "近在咫尺的劲敌……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1039_p", "source_sha256": "47d259c24cf8466ccfcd2f5de173d49474050cf57c238973dbb14ce78007e125", "ja": "うん。ライバルだからこそ、力を合わせた時……\nひとりじゃ見られない景色を見る事ができる。", "zh": "嗯，正因为是劲敌，当大家同心协力时……\n才能看见那片一个人时无法看到的风景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1040_p", "source_sha256": "9747546a46d2d3a52c4c19b5757bb4f0ac5826e90df33074aaae821664473826", "ja": "琴葉はきっと、未来たちとそれを見たいんだ。春香も。\nそれからきっと、静香や翼もな。", "zh": "琴叶一定也想和未来你们一起看到那片风景。\n春香也是，还有静香、翼一定都是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_04_1042_p", "source_sha256": "d98b1ec61ca08e9e4dc0698a1d2db1020c04e73c341a568e31e1d17bf9dcfc88", "ja": "（誰かと競い合う事は、相手を嫌いになる事じゃない。\n……その事が、未来にも伝わるといいんだけど）", "zh": "（和他人较劲并不代表讨厌对方。\n……要是能让未来理解这个道理就好了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
